    "body": "@tabatkins brought this up the other day. A syntax that might work is\r\n\r\n`(name → value, name2 → value2)`\r\n\r\nwhich makes them look similar to tuples, except that the names of the items are visible and can appear in any order.\r\n\r\nAs discussed in https://github.com/whatwg/whatwg.org/pull/396 not all structs necessarily want a literal syntax and we should make note of that if we decide to add syntax.",
