    "body": "I think it's good to be consistent between the syntaxes if possible; structs and maps *are* very similar and having their key/value separator be different seems confusing.\r\n\r\n(But I do like the colon over the arrow, same as @annevk; maybe we could switch (or at least allow) maps to use colons as well?)",
